{"duration_api_ms":381585,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"02b0f319-cde2-4dfb-accc-3cf78b8dc922","total_cost_usd":1.4865454000000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":34,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69305,"cache_read_input_tokens":1100876,"output_tokens":35582,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":22596},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69305,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":593,"cache_read_input_tokens":92221,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2786},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1447,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0001542,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":34,"outputTokens":35582,"cacheReadInputTokens":1100876,"cacheCreationInputTokens":69305,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.4863912,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":22596,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":69305,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"extra_usage_disabled","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":17,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I repaired the network by making it read the east left-turn pocket (E2) wherever it used to read the failed west one (W2). It changes 128 parameters. All three files are in `work/`; the test TTS can only be predicted, since no simulator was run.\n\n**What I changed and why:** The network leans heavily on W2: raising it from 0 to 1 takes its EW_left picks from 21% to 71%. With W2 stuck at 0 it under-serves west left-turners, and their 3-car pocket backs up into the upstream lane. E2 has the same demand as W2 and gets green in the same phase, so I added the W2 input weights onto E2's inputs:\n- `W1[:,5] += W1[:,11]` (halting count)\n- `W1[:,17] += W1[:,23]` (vehicle count)\n\nThe network now behaves exactly as if W2 read the same as E2. All other weights are unchanged.\n\n**Parameters changed:** 128 of 7428 (two columns of W1), well under the 371 limit.\n\n**Checks:**\n- **Choosing the fix:** I faked the same failure on the south pocket, whose partner is the north pocket. Copying the partner beat a constant, a shrunk copy and upstream-lane terms in both directions. It matched the full-detector decisions 88–89% of the time, against 85–88% with the fault.\n- **Correctness:** the edit count is 128 after saving and reloading. On all 14,337 recorded states the decisions are identical to the original network fed W2 = E2. When E2 is empty, nothing changes.\n\n**Predictions:** low 35.3, nominal 46.0, high 57.8 veh-h. These sit between the faulty network and the full-detector one. I expect most of the gain under high demand and the smallest gain under low demand, where the two pockets differ more.","ttft_ms":2505,"type":"result","duration_ms":392759,"uuid":"5c4753a5-151b-41ac-9d60-b7983c576f2f","ttft_stream_ms":2018,"time_to_request_ms":50,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":2,"system_prompt":6,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":9,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_app